diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index ef16e7c..51d7b34 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Conditions can name `env` attributes, supplied per request as `Request(..., env={...})` or `warden check --env KEY=VALUE`.
 - Fixed: comparisons in conditions treated numbers as text, so `user.clearance >= 3` refused a clearance of 10. Numbers, including numeric strings, now compare as numbers.
 - Audit log records carry `"decision": "allow"` or `"deny"` in place of `"allowed": true/false`. Older logs are not read.
 - A rule can name several roles separated by commas (`allow viewer,auditor read reports/**`); it applies to anyone holding any of them.
